
The AI Configs API allows you to create, retrieve, and edit AI Configs, AI Config variations, and AI model configurations.

An AI Config is a resource in LaunchDarkly that you can use to customize, test, and roll out new large language models (LLMs) within your generative AI applications. Within each AI Config, you define one or more AI Config variations, each of which includes a model configuration and one or more messages. The model configuration can be a standard one from the list provided by LaunchDarkly, or you can define your own custom AI model configuration.

To learn more, read AI Configs https://launchdarkly.com/docs/home/ai-configs.

Usage:
  ldcli ai-configs [command]

Available Commands:
  create-agent-graph                 Create new agent graph
  create-ai-config                   Create new AI Config
  create-ai-config-variation         Create AI Config variation
  create-ai-tool                     Create an AI tool
  create-model-config                Create an AI model config
  create-prompt-snippet              Create a prompt snippet
  create-restricted-models           Add AI models to the restricted list
  delete-agent-graph                 Delete agent graph
  delete-ai-config                   Delete AI Config
  delete-ai-config-variation         Delete AI Config variation
  delete-ai-tool                     Delete AI tool
  delete-model-config                Delete an AI model config
  delete-restricted-models           Remove AI models from the restricted list
  get-agent-graph                    Get agent graph
  get-ai-config                      Get AI Config
  get-ai-config-metrics              Get AI Config metrics
  get-ai-config-metrics-by-variation Get AI Config metrics by variation
  get-ai-config-targeting            Show an AI Config's targeting
  get-ai-tool                        Get AI tool
  get-model-config                   Get AI model config
  list-agent-graphs                  List agent graphs
  list-ai-config-variation           Get AI Config variation
  list-ai-configs                    List AI Configs
  list-ai-tool-versions              List AI tool versions
  list-ai-tools                      List AI tools
  list-model-configs                 List AI model configs
  update-agent-graph                 Update agent graph
  update-ai-config                   Update AI Config
  update-ai-config-targeting         Update AI Config targeting
  update-ai-config-variation         Update AI Config variation
  update-ai-tool                     Update AI tool

Global flags:
  -h, --help                  Get help about any command
      --access-token string   LaunchDarkly access token with write-level access
      --analytics-opt-out     Opt out of analytics tracking
      --base-uri string       LaunchDarkly base URI (default "https://app.launchdarkly.com")
      --fields strings        Comma-separated list of top-level fields to include in JSON output (e.g., --fields key,name,kind)
      --json                  Output JSON format (shorthand for --output json)
  -o, --output string         Output format: json, plaintext, or markdown (default: plaintext in a terminal, json otherwise) (default "json")

Use "ldcli ai-configs [command] --help" for more information about a command.
